# Dated .env backups. `*.env` above does not catch these (they end in the
# suffix, not in ".env"), so they sat untracked for months and kept
# `git status --porcelain` non-empty, which is the condition the Stop hook
# uses to decide whether to run `make check`. Result: the check ran on every
# turn in this repo.
.env.bak-*
.env.known-good-*

# Agent worktrees live inside the repo and are never part of it.
.claude/worktrees/
